    {
      "id": "ancYNmvcYMCWGT63OEzrM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 924.0570007565734,
      "y": 540.2960672698416,
      "width": 447.979736328125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 418352891,
      "version": 534,
      "versionNonce": 561343638,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791392569305,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DOWN: jump 1 (5 -> 9)\nRIGHT: jump 4 (5 - > 6), skips a whole column",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DOWN: jump 1 (5 -> 9)\nRIGHT: jump 4 (5 - > 6), skips a whole column",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NCTEKKcOZunLymli96FxW",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -27.031414777777,
      "y": 663.3500668730162,
      "width": 937.9999999999999,
      "height": 530,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1767339317,
      "version": 168,
      "versionNonce": 143092182,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791392569305,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "C-goO0yvI5itl0hbBvcXw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 21.33858685559315,
      "y": 685.8500673015876,
      "width": 821.5994873046875,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 813460987,
      "version": 1300,
      "versionNonce": 1323810582,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791392569305,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Notes:\n\nStride = how far you jump in memory to take on step in a direction.\n\nROW-MAJOR (row after row): step right = jump 1, step down = jump width\n\nCOLUMN-MAJOR (column after column): step down = jump 1, step right = jump height\n\n- Same picture, same pixels. Only the order in memory changes.\n\n- We use row-major (RUST, PNG, PMPP). Column-major\nshows up in cuBLAS later.\n\n- Neighbouring threads should read neighbouring memory. In row-major, that means\nneighbouring columns.\n\n- The direction you store things in is the direction that's 1 apart, row major\nstores rows, so moving along a row is +1. Column major stores columns,\nso moving along a column is +1.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Notes:\n\nStride = how far you jump in memory to take on step in a direction.\n\nROW-MAJOR (row after row): step right = jump 1, step down = jump width\n\nCOLUMN-MAJOR (column after column): step down = jump 1, step right = jump height\n\n- Same picture, same pixels. Only the order in memory changes.\n\n- We use row-major (RUST, PNG, PMPP). Column-major\nshows up in cuBLAS later.\n\n- Neighbouring threads should read neighbouring memory. In row-major, that means\nneighbouring columns.\n\n- The direction you store things in is the direction that's 1 apart, row major\nstores rows, so moving along a row is +1. Column major stores columns,\nso moving along a column is +1.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-3ayZop8ubHKC9JYmjT4R",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -27.031415396825196,
      "y": 1234.910873968255,
      "width": 937.9999999999999,
      "height": 394.0000000000004,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 552074171,
      "version": 259,
      "versionNonce": 688614486,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791392569305,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "OfawdiWWnY9BWOOw0SOQT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30.638574029513848,
      "y": 1257.410874396826,
      "width": 802.99951171875,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1267125339,
      "version": 1913,
      "versionNonce": 1556842440,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791535179252,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STRIDES ARE THE LINEARIZING FORMULA\n\nindex = row * (row stride) + col * (column stride)\n\nRow-major: row stride = width, column stride = 1 -> row * width + col\n\nColumn-major: row stride = 1, column stride = height -> col * height + row\n\n- The formula is always the same recipe: multiply each coordinate by its\nstride and add. Only the strides change.\n\n- Memory has no layout. The strides WE use in the formula decide how to read it.\n\nStrides are what turn a 2D position (row, col) into a 1D spot in memory.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "STRIDES ARE THE LINEARIZING FORMULA\n\nindex = row * (row stride) + col * (column stride)\n\nRow-major: row stride = width, column stride = 1 -> row * width + col\n\nColumn-major: row stride = 1, column stride = height -> col * height + row\n\n- The formula is always the same recipe: multiply each coordinate by its\nstride and add. Only the strides change.\n\n- Memory has no layout. The strides WE use in the formula decide how to read it.\n\nStrides are what turn a 2D position (row, col) into a 1D spot in memory.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
  "appState": {
    "gridSize": 20,
    "gridStep": 5,
    "gridModeEnabled": false,
    "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"
  },
  "files": {}
